  <item>
    <title>EP191 AI時代，不要再來當配音員了？廣告配音員的幕後工作與職涯轉變 feat. 賈培德（德仔）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ace3e35e742e36efcc27930</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ace3e35e742e36efcc27930</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>這集邀請到配音員、典禮司儀、自媒體創作者賈培德（德仔），和我們分享廣告配音的幕後，也聊聊從廣播、劇場走向Podcast與YouTube的職涯選擇。</span><br><br><span>我們會聊到：</span><br><span>🎙️ 一支30秒的廣告，配音員會錄多久？</span><br><span>🎧 面對客戶各種抽象、矛盾的要求，怎麼找到對的聲音？</span><br><span>🗣️ 想靠聲音吃飯，聲音好聽、具備天分就夠了嗎？</span><br><span>📱 經營Podcast與YouTube，投入與回報如何取捨？</span><br><span>🤖 AI越來越會模仿真人，配音員還有哪些不可取代的價值？</span><br><br><span>極致藝術《海象莫雷的漂流日誌》親子音樂劇</span><br><span>🔹演出資訊：</span><br><span>【新北市藝中心演藝廳】</span><br><span>11/14 (六) <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a>、<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a></span><br><span>11/15 (日) <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a>、<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a></span><br><br><span>【衛武營國家藝術文化中心戲劇院】</span><br><span>12/12 (六) <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a>、<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a></span><br><span>12/13 (日) <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a>、<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a></span><br><br><span>【台中中山堂】</span><br><span>2027/1/16 (六) <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a>、<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a></span><br><span>2027/1/17 (日) <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a>、<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a></span><br><br><span>🔹購票連結：</span><a href="https://www.opentix.life/event/2087017782302437377" data-url="https://www.opentix.life/event/2087017782302437377"><span>www.opentix.life</span></a><br><span>🔹折扣碼：Goodjob（85折）</span><br><br><span>Facebook 粉專：賈文青德仔&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.facebook.com/dzchia.tw/" data-url="https://www.facebook.com/dzchia.tw/"><span>www.facebook.com</span></a><br><span>Instegram 帳號：賈文青德仔&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.instagram.com/dzchia.tw/" data-url="https://www.instagram.com/dzchia.tw/"><span>www.instagram.com</span></a><br><span>YouTube 頻道：賈文青比你愛臺灣&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@hipstermyass" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@hipstermyass"><span>www.youtube.com</span></a><br><span>Podcast 節目：賈文青無料案內所&nbsp;</span><a href="https://open.firstory.fm/user/hipstermyass/platforms" data-url="https://open.firstory.fm/user/hipstermyass/platforms"><span>open.firstory.fm</span></a><br><br><span>-----</span><br><span>Fiona的 </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5d6f4c020000000001001ca5" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5d6f4c020000000001001ca5"><span>小紅書</span></a><br><span>Fiona的 </span><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@coolestwork" data-url="https://www.tiktok.com/@coolestwork"><span>Tiktok</span></a><br><span>Fiona 的 Instagram：</span><a href="https://www.instagram.com/coolestwork" data-url="https://www.instagram.com/coolestwork"><span>www.instagram.com</span></a><br><span>節目粉絲專頁：</span><a href="https://www.facebook.com/coolestwork" data-url="https://www.facebook.com/coolestwork"><span>www.facebook.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
